---
// Small uppercase label above page headings.
---
<div class="eyebrow"><span></span><slot /></div>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--eyebrow);
  }
  span { width: 32px; height: 1px; background: var(--eyebrow); flex-shrink: 0; }
</style>
